<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Telekom 6-mth net 889.9 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Telekom 6-mth net 889.9 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 889.9    vs	 841.8</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 35.6    vs	  42.2</p>
<p>    Turnover		 3,411.9    vs     2,960.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 1,197.3    vs     1,095.9</p>
<p>    Minorities	  add    7.5    vs   add   2.4</p>
<p>    Dividend		     nil    vs	   nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Telekom Malaysia Bhd is in the country's privatised telecommunications  utility.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
